heading "Email address" level=2
text "Your email is ."
text "me @x.co"
text "New email"
textbox "New email" value=""
button "Change email" [disabled]
text "Type the new email address you want to use."
heading "Hide your dancer profile" level=2
text "You have no dancer profile, so there is nothing to hide. You can still download your data or delete your account below."
heading "Your data" level=2
text "Saves a file with what we hold about you: your profile, ratings and attendance."
button "Download my data"
heading "Delete account" level=2
text "Your account is hidden from everyone at once. Sign in within 30 days to undo it."
link "Delete account" href=/account/settings/delete
heading "Sign out" level=2
text "Signed in as ."
text "me @x.co"
button "Sign out"
text "Lost a phone, or signed in somewhere else? This signs you out everywhere, this device included."
button "Sign out of all devices""
`;

